WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.860
What's up guys?

00:00:00.860 --> 00:00:04.120
A couple years ago we built a really cool gun wall for all our prop guns.

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:08.500
But since then, not only has jake gotten a degree in law and a doctorate in engineering,

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.440
but we got WAY more guns, so we gotta keep them all somewhere

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:15.300
So he built a brand new gun wall that's even cooler than our last one

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:16.020
Jake: Let's go!

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:16.880
*clap clap*

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.360
Sam: Okay, not bad, not bad.

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:24.880
BUT, but, this is what I'm really excited about

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:27.320
They installed lights in here, too. Check this out.

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:29.960
Jake: Oooohhh. Shiny!

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:30.520
Sam: Yeah.

00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:32.080
Man, which one's my favorite?

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:33.700
I like this one a lot, this one's cool.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:34.420
Jake, what about you?

00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:36.860
Jake: Ah, I'm always a big fan of the shot- shot- shotguns, man.

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:37.780
Just classic.

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:39.780
Johnny: I'm going with the Glock over here.

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:40.960
Sam &amp; Jake: That's not a Glock.

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:41.680
Johnny: It's not a Glock?

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:44.260
Wren: My favorite gun is probably this gun.

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:46.260
What's your favorite gun?

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:47.160
Cmike: Revolver.

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:48.420
Wren: Classic!

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:49.300
*gun recoil*

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:49.880
Cmike: Woaahhh!

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:51.040
Sam: Some of the are loaded.

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:52.660
Wren: You just leave it. Hahahaha!

